<title>NETHERLANDS: Internatio-Mueller buys automation firm.</title>
<headline>Internatio-Mueller buys automation firm.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch transport and trading company Internatio-Mueller NV said on Friday it had bought WPS Holding BV for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>Unlisted WPS is a supplier of automated parking systems with a strong position in the Dutch market and an annual turnover of more than 20 million guilders, Internatio said.  </p>
<p>WPS also exports its products to various countries in Europe, North and Latin America and the Far East, it added.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
